what is up everybody it's animak here  for  anime uproar and today i will be  breaking down the crazy new events  in the boku no hero story including  deku's new power and the further  evolution of his quirk  all for one's terrifying true intentions  and the possible end of the epic war arc  that has been raging for the better part  of the past  year there is so much to discuss and  dive into so let's do it  if you enjoyed the boku no hero content  here on the channel and you want us to  keep it going please  leave a like to let me know it really  does help and if you happen to be new to  anime  pro or maybe you just haven't subscribed  yet make this the video that you  subscribe  and hit that notification bell to turn  on all  notifications it's annoying but you  really have to go through the trouble of  hitting that bell  and then selecting that option that says  all if you don't do that you're still  going to miss a ton of our videos it's  just how youtube works  you can also hit me up on twitter and  instagram at anime uproar  finally this video will contain boku no  hero manga spoilers  so please proceed with caution you have  been  warned the previous installment of the  story left off with mr compresses  big gamble compressed decided to  sacrifice his life  in order to allow shigaraki and the  other villains to escape  from the heroes this turn of events  implied that the big battle between  heroes and villains in jakku was about  to  end because the villains were about to  retreat  i was skeptical about that because for  example toga hasn't really done anything  major except for her brief encounter  with ochako  but the latest chapter does seem to  confirm the retreat  although a bunch of twists and turns  definitely occur along the way  including deku unlocking yet another  quirk and  all for one possessing shiguraki's body  and revealing his  sinister true intentions the chapter  starts off with  deku looking like the poster boy for  2020  this has definitely been a rough year  for all of us so deku's face right here  is  absolutely hashtag relatable deku had  passed  out as a result of dobby's massive heat  wave  and when he comes too deku is worried  about shoto's well-being  after all deku loves to worry about  others even though he himself  looks like he is in horrible shape but  to be fair  shoto was just dropped by a massive  attack from dobby so deku wasn't the  only one  worried shoto is injured but thankfully  he is alive and he is  conscious in the very next moment deku  feels a sharp  pain in his head and deku concludes that  this must be another one of his hidden  quirks  this must be danger detection which had  once belonged to the fourth  one for all user this quirk seems to  basically give deku a spidey sense  the ability to sense imminent danger  before it actually occurs  this makes a lot of sense because in the  past horikoshi said  that spider-man is one of his main  inspirations in terms of what a hero  should be  and so it isn't too surprising that  horikoshi would give deku a quirk like  black whip  which allows him to move kind of like  spider-man and a quirk like danger  detection which gives him a spidey sense  with that said since this quirk is only  being revealed now  we can't say for sure whether spidey  senses are its only application  maybe this quirk can also boost deku's  other senses or something along those  lines  or maybe the quirk has some other  potentially useful applications like  seeing into the future for a few seconds  or something like that  personally i do believe that there is  more to this quirk than just a spidey  sense  because we can't forget that all might  had scribbled out some of the notes  about the fourth one for all user and  his quirk  that really makes me wonder what exactly  those notes said  and what made all might want to scribble  them out  was he afraid that if deku knew this  information he would push the quirk too  far  and hurt himself in some way do